# kills: a zoom with the keyboard up is left alone at every pan position
# suite: node --test --test-name-pattern ^a.zoom.with.the.keyboard.up.is.left.alone.at.every.pan.position$ tests/e2e.test.js
# The zoom gate goes away, so a pinch-zoom is measured as a keyboard again
# (queue row 87). vv.height shrinks under zoom exactly as it does under a
# keyboard, so the sheet lifts and caps itself for a reader who was only
# zooming in.
